maintainers         {gmail.com:audvare @Tatsh} openmaintainer
description         Machine learning video, GIF and image upscaler and frame interpolator.
long_description    Video2X upscales videos, GIFs and images with Real-ESRGAN, Real-CUGAN or \
                    Anime4K (libplacebo), and interpolates frames with RIFE, on the GPU through \
                    Vulkan (MoltenVK on macOS). It installs libvideo2x and the video2x command \
                    line tool, and the video2x-qt6 port is its graphical interface.
supported_archs     x86_64 arm64

boost.version       1.88

